<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- ============================================================
       泰拉钢（Botania_Terrasteel · 4000 点 · 前置「精灵之门」）
         · 泰拉钢锭：魔力钢锭 + 精灵石英 + 20,000 魔力，在泰拉凝聚台里合成
         · 泰拉刃 / 泰拉甲 / 泰拉头盔，各自吃 1 锭
         · 1 锭 = 1 件装备（已定，见开发文档第一部分 §9–§10）
       ============================================================ -->

  <!-- 泰拉钢锭：终局主料 -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="Botania_MaterialBase">
    <defName>Botania_TerrasteelIngot</defName>
    <label>terrasteel ingot</label>
    <description>The main material of the late game: manasteel fed elven quartz inside the agglomeration platform until it becomes terrasteel. It is no building material, and the late gear and the great flowers are all waiting on it.

This metal has begun to put out roots: green-gold, warm to the touch, heavier than it looks.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/Resource/Botania/TerrasteelIngot</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>240</MarketValue>
      <MaxHitPoints>200</MaxHitPoints>
      <Mass>0.4</Mass>
      <Flammability>0.0</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>0.0</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
  </ThingDef>

  <!-- 泰拉刃：30 伤害 / 45% 穿透 / 2.0 秒；装备后获得「剑气」技能 -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseMeleeWeapon_Sharp_Quality">
    <defName>Botania_TerraBlade</defName>
    <label>terrasteel blade</label>
    <description>A close-quarters blade for the late game: a terrasteel edge on a livingwood grip. Swung, it makes the air in front of you move with it - at the price of mana drawn from a source nearby.

The edge itself is ordinary; the strange part is that the metal remembers the arc of the swing.</description>
    <possessionCount>1</possessionCount>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/Equipment/WeaponMelee/Botania/TerrasteelSword</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>(1.15,1.15)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <techLevel>Ultra</techLevel>
    <weaponTags>
      <li>BotaniaMelee</li>
    </weaponTags>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToMake>24000</WorkToMake>
      <Mass>2.4</Mass>
      <MarketValue>3600</MarketValue>
    </statBases>
    <costList>
      <Botania_TerrasteelIngot>1</Botania_TerrasteelIngot>
      <Botania_Livingwood>2</Botania_Livingwood>
      <Botania_PixieDust>2</Botania_PixieDust>
    </costList>
    <recipeMaker>
      <researchPrerequisite>Botania_Terrasteel</researchPrerequisite>
      <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
      <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
      <soundWorking>Recipe_Machining</soundWorking>
      <recipeUsers>
        <li>FueledSmithy</li>
        <li>ElectricSmithy</li>
      </recipeUsers>
      <displayPriority>353</displayPriority>
      <skillRequirements>
        <Crafting>8</Crafting>
      </skillRequirements>
    </recipeMaker>
    <equippedAngleOffset>-65</equippedAngleOffset>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>pommel</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>10</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.0</cooldownTime>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>point</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Stab</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>26</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.0</cooldownTime>
        <armorPenetration>0.35</armorPenetration>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>edge</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Cut</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>30</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.0</cooldownTime>
        <armorPenetration>0.45</armorPenetration>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <comps>
      <li Class="Botania.CompProperties_TerraBlade">
        <waveManaCost>400</waveManaCost>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

  <!-- 泰拉甲（毕业装备）：锐器 109% / 钝器 44% / 热能 51%
       参考基准：元素甲 104% / 42% / 49%；本引擎的圣装（Cataphract）基底是 120% / 50% / 60%
       （旧稿写成 120% / 62%，那个数是错的）。
       定位是「把一条科技线走到底」的终点，所以三项全面压过元素甲；
       但锐器 109 与钝器 44 都低于圣装 120 / 50，热能 51% 也低于 60%，
       三项只压过飞蝗系与元素甲，并不「达到或超过原版最好的甲」。
       热能 51% 比元素甲热能 49% 小幅提升。
       代价不变：质量 11、移速 -0.10、需要工艺 8。 -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelBase">
    <defName>Botania_TerrasteelArmor</defName>
    <label>terrasteel armor</label>
    <description>A suit of terrasteel plate covering the whole body. It stops a blade almost completely, a hammer still finds a way through, and it weighs on the wearer's step.

The scratches grow back on their own, until after a while you cannot tell which place took the blade.</description>
    <techLevel>Ultra</techLevel>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Botania_TerrasteelArmor/Botania_TerrasteelArmor</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>1.00</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToMake>30000</WorkToMake>
      <MaxHitPoints>400</MaxHitPoints>
      <Mass>11</Mass>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>1.09</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.44</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <ArmorRating_Heat>0.51</ArmorRating_Heat>
      <Insulation_Cold>80</Insulation_Cold>
      <Insulation_Heat>11</Insulation_Heat>
      <EquipDelay>5</EquipDelay>
      <MarketValue>3000</MarketValue>
    </statBases>
    <equippedStatOffsets>
      <MoveSpeed>-0.10</MoveSpeed>
    </equippedStatOffsets>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>ApparelArmor</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <costList>
      <Botania_TerrasteelIngot>1</Botania_TerrasteelIngot>
      <Botania_Livingwood>2</Botania_Livingwood>
      <Botania_PixieDust>2</Botania_PixieDust>
    </costList>
    <recipeMaker>
      <researchPrerequisite>Botania_Terrasteel</researchPrerequisite>
      <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
      <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
      <soundWorking>Recipe_Machining</soundWorking>
      <recipeUsers>
        <li>FueledSmithy</li>
        <li>ElectricSmithy</li>
      </recipeUsers>
      <displayPriority>350</displayPriority>
      <skillRequirements>
        <Crafting>8</Crafting>
      </skillRequirements>
    </recipeMaker>
    <apparel>
      <wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Botania_TerrasteelArmor/Botania_TerrasteelArmor</wornGraphicPath>
      <bodyPartGroups>
        <li>Torso</li>
        <li>Neck</li>
        <li>Shoulders</li>
        <li>Arms</li>
        <li>Hands</li>
        <li>Legs</li>
        <li>Feet</li>
      </bodyPartGroups>
      <layers>
        <li>Shell</li>
      </layers>
    </apparel>
  </ThingDef>

  <!-- 泰拉头盔（毕业装备）：锐器 65% / 钝器 26% / 热能 31%
       与泰拉甲保持 0.6 的比例（元素套也是 0.6），热能略低于甲但明显高于元素头盔。
       头盔不加移速惩罚。 -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelBase">
    <defName>Botania_TerrasteelHelmet</defName>
    <label>terrasteel helmet</label>
    <description>A full helm of terrasteel with a visor of elven quartz. It turns a blade very well, and it does not shut the wearer's view away.

The metal closes over the face by itself, leaving a gap just wide enough to see the world through.</description>
    <techLevel>Ultra</techLevel>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Botania_TerrasteelHelmet/Botania_TerrasteelHelmet</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.9</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToMake>20000</WorkToMake>
      <MaxHitPoints>280</MaxHitPoints>
      <Mass>3</Mass>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.65</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.26</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <ArmorRating_Heat>0.31</ArmorRating_Heat>
      <Insulation_Cold>6</Insulation_Cold>
      <Insulation_Heat>2</Insulation_Heat>
      <EquipDelay>3</EquipDelay>
      <MarketValue>1800</MarketValue>
    </statBases>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>ArmorHeadgear</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <costList>
      <Botania_TerrasteelIngot>1</Botania_TerrasteelIngot>
      <Botania_PixieDust>1</Botania_PixieDust>
    </costList>
    <recipeMaker>
      <researchPrerequisite>Botania_Terrasteel</researchPrerequisite>
      <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
      <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
      <soundWorking>Recipe_Machining</soundWorking>
      <recipeUsers>
        <li>FueledSmithy</li>
        <li>ElectricSmithy</li>
      </recipeUsers>
      <displayPriority>351</displayPriority>
      <skillRequirements>
        <Crafting>8</Crafting>
      </skillRequirements>
    </recipeMaker>
    <apparel>
      <wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Botania_TerrasteelHelmet/Botania_TerrasteelHelmet</wornGraphicPath>
      <bodyPartGroups>
        <li>FullHead</li>
      </bodyPartGroups>
      <layers>
        <li>Overhead</li>
      </layers>
      <parentTagDef>ApparelHead</parentTagDef>
    </apparel>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
